{{also|bút|bût|būt|Bụt|But|but-|бут}}
==English==
{{wikipedia|BUT}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|but}}, {{m|enm|buten}}, {{m|enm|boute}}, {{m|enm|bouten}}, from {{inh|en|ang|būtan|t=without, outside of, except, only}}, equivalent to {{af|en|be-|out|nocat=1}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|but}}, {{m|sco|bot|t=outside, without, but}}, {{cog|stq|buute|t=without}}, {{cog|fy|bûten|t=outside of, apart from, other than, except, but}}, {{cog|nl|buiten|t=outside}}, {{cog|nds-nl|buten|t=outside}}, {{cog|nds-de|buuten}}, {{m|nds-de|buute|t=outside}}, obsolete {{cog|de|baußen|t=outside}}, {{cog|lb|baussen}}. Compare {{l|en|bin}}, {{l|en|about}}.

Eclipsed non-native {{noncog|enm|mes|t=but}} borrowed from {{noncog|fro|mes}}, {{m|fro|mais}} (> {{noncog|fr|mais|t=but}}).

